#: ../../../source/development.rst:5
msgid "Reading the Code"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/development.rst:7
msgid "Start at ``app/Hub_Main.cpp``. ``setup()`` and ``loop()`` initialize and update the hub services through the C-style facade of each component:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/development.rst:9
msgid "``SRV_EspNow_Update()`` delivers queued remote packets to ``SWC_Robot_OnRemote()``; ``Robot`` validates the sequence and source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/development.rst:10
msgid "``SRV_Hmi_Update()`` reads touchscreen commands and drives ``Robot`` through ``SWC_Robot_Joy()``, ``SWC_Robot_RunMotor()`` and friends."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/development.rst:11
msgid "``SWC_Robot_Update()`` applies drive commands on a 20 ms tick and stops after the 500 ms link timeout."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/development.rst:13
msgid "``subModuleInit()`` wires the hub in one place: ``Wire.begin()`` for the I2C bus, then ``CDD_Gpio_Begin()``, ``SWC_Robot_Begin()``, ``SRV_Hmi_Begin()`` and ``SRV_EspNow_Begin()``. Each facade owns its own hardware setup (the HMI UART and the WiFi/ESP-NOW start live inside their components), so ``Hub_Main.cpp`` contains no component classes or globals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/development.rst:15
msgid "Reusable modules are under ``components/``. Public headers are in each component's ``api/`` directory, implementation files are in ``src/``, and board-specific settings are in ``cfg/s3_devkit/``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/development.rst:18
msgid "Building the Firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/development.rst:20
msgid "Install PlatformIO Core or the PlatformIO IDE extension, then run these commands from the repository root:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/development.rst:28
msgid "Specify ``-e hub`` explicitly because the legacy PlatformIO configuration is also imported by the root project. The Mega 2560 and ESP8266 firmware is kept under ``legacy/`` and is not part of the hub build."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/development.rst:30
msgid "The hub build compiles ``app/`` and ``components/*/src/``. ``tools/pio_components.py`` adds each component's ``api/`` and selected ``cfg/s3_devkit/`` directories to the include path."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/development.rst:33
msgid "Staged Testing Strategy"
msgstr ""

