msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/development.rst:37
msgid "**Wireless Test:** verify the configured remote MAC and channel, CRC validation, sequence handling and link timeout."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/development.rst:38
msgid "**Integration Test:** full test from the remote to physical movement."
msgstr ""

